hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3565","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah tumhara hirs barhaye aur dobara na karna."
"3566","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere Rab ne mujhe aik namaz zyada di aur wo witr hai; us ka waqt Isha se fajr tuloo hone tak hai."
"3567","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik aadmi ne gaon mein apne bhai ki ziyarat ki to Allah ne us ke raaste par farishta bitha diya; us ne kaha: Kahan chahte ho? Us ne kaha: Is gaon mein apne bhai ke paas; us ne kaha: Kiya us ka tum par koi ehsan hai jis ki tum parwarish karte ho? Us ne kaha: Nahi, siwa is ke ke main us se Allah ke liye mohabbat karta hun; us ne kaha: Main tumhari taraf Allah ka qasid hun ke Allah tum se mohabbat karta hai jaise tum ne us se mohabbat ki."
"3568","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kabhi kabhi ziyarat karo, mohabbat barhegi."
"3569","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use apne upar lao chahe kaante se."
"3570","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqa-e-Fitr rozedar ke liye laghw aur behayai se taharat hai aur miskeenon ke liye khana hai; jo use namaz se pehle ada kare to wo qubool-shuda zakat hai; aur jo use namaz ke baad ada kare to wo sadqon mein se aik sadqa hai."
"3571","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqa-e-Fitr har musalman par farz hai, aazaad aur ghulam, mard aur aurat musalmanon mein se: khajoor ka aik sa' ya jau ka aik sa'."
"3572","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zamzam khane se khana hai aur bimari se shifa hai."
"3573","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Unhein un ke khoon ke saath kafan do; kyunke jo zakhmi Allah ke raaste mein zakhmi hota hai wo qayamat ke din is haal mein aayega ke khoon behta hoga, us ka rang khoon ka rang hoga aur us ki khushbu mushk ki khushbu hogi."
"3574","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tolo aur jhuka do."
"3575","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Donon aankhon ka zina dekhna hai."
"3576","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zaban ka zina bolna hai."
"3577","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qabron ki ziyarat karo; kyunke wo tumhein aakhirat yaad dilati hain."
"3578","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qabron ki ziyarat karo aur behuda na kaho."
"3579","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah tumhein taqwa ka saman de, tumhara gunah bakhsh de aur tumhare liye khair aasaan kar de tum jahan kahin ho."
"3580","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran ko apni aawazon se khubsurat banao."
"3581","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran ko apni aawazon se khubsurat banao; kyunke achchi aawaz Quran ko husn mein barha deti hai."
"3582","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kishmish aur khajoor hi sharaab hai."
"3583","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zubair meri phuphi ke bete aur meri ummat mein se mere hawari hain."
"3584","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zakat in chaar mein hai: gehun, jau, kishmish aur khajoor."
